        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" parent="step-3-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reserve Nonce and Record Transaction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Nonce state and the tracker row share a wallet partition in one per-chain table, so each state change spanning both is a single ACID TransactWriteItems instead of a cross-store write&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="55" width="600" y="245" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" parent="step-4-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" parent="step-4-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Nitro Enclave Signing&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Lambda &amp;rarr; NLB &amp;rarr; EC2 server &amp;rarr; vsock &amp;rarr; enclave signs hash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="55" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="600" y="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" parent="step-5-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" parent="step-5-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Decrypt&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Enclave fetches encrypted key from Secrets Manager, decrypts via KMS with PCR0 attestation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="600" y="385" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-badge-legend" parent="step-6-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" parent="step-6-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Broadcast to Chain&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Lambda persists the exact signed bytes, then sends eth_sendRawTransaction to the EVM chain RPC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="600" y="460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-badge-legend" parent="step-7-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="7" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-desc-legend" parent="step-7-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Confirm and Finalize&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Fargate watcher subscribes to blocks (WS) and atomically finalizes the tracker row and nonce state in one DynamoDB transaction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="600" y="535" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-badge-legend" parent="step-8-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="8" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-desc-legend" parent="step-8-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bounded Fee Replacement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;For a stuck tx the watcher takes a leased DynamoDB generation claim and sends an identity-only request to the replacement queue. The separately permissioned replacement Lambda re-checks intent, policy, and hard fee ceilings, then signs and activates a same-nonce candidate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="85" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-note" parent="legend-container" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=2;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Orange dashed = per-chain (SQS + DLQ, broadcast Lambda, DynamoDB, replacement queue + Lambda, Fargate watcher). Teal dashed = shared signing infrastructure (NLB, Nitro Enclaves, Secrets Manager, KMS). A single DynamoDB table per chain is the sole nonce authority: nonce state, tracker rows, replacement families, watcher cursor, and idempotency claims share the wallet partition, so every multi-key change is one ACID transaction and nonce state cannot diverge from transaction state. Each queue has its own dead-letter queue. CloudWatch alarms cover Lambda errors/p99/throttles, DLQ depth, queue age, ECS task count, watcher block progress, DynamoDB throttles and system errors, and replacement policy exhaustion — alerts fire to SNS.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="590" y="640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
